ate at the rear to park your toys, backing a walking trail and just steps away from Landsdowne Park. Downstairs, the fully finished basement has new vinyl plank flooring, a cozy gas fireplace, updated bathroom, laundry room with sink and 2 additional bedrooms - including one with a massive walk-in closet. With - HWT (2019) 35-year shingles (2015) and a great location close to schools, parks and shopping, this is a fantastic family home with space to grow. (id:67522)","facts":[["Price","$439,900"],["Type","House"],["Style","Bi-level"],["Bedrooms","5"],["Bathrooms","2"],["Living area","1,104 sq ft"],["Lot size","4,270 sq ft"],["Year built","1999"],["Neighbourhood","Lakewood"],["Town","Spruce Grove"],["Postal code","T7X3Z9"],["MLS® number","E4513728"],["Listed","October 21, 2026"]],"features":[["Appliances","Washer, Refrigerator, Dishwasher, Stove, Dryer, Hood Fan, Window Coverings"],["Heating","Forced air"],["Basement","Finished, Full"],["Parking","Attached Garage"]],"rooms":[["Living room","Main level","10ft x 16'11\""],["Dining room","Main level","7'9\" x 14'9\""],["Kitchen","Main level","9'3\" x 14'9\""],["Family room","Lower level","18'1\" x 22'3\""],["Primary Bedroom","Main level","15'8 x 11'10\""],["Bedroom 2","Main level","9'3\" x 10'8\""],["Bedroom 3","Main level","11'1\" x 14'8\""],["Bedroom 4","Lower level","13'4 x 11'10\""],["Bedroom 5","Lower level","12' x 16'9\""],["Utility room","Lower level","13' x 25'"]],"courtesy":"Katie Crawford, RE/MAX PREFERRED CHOICE and Lykke Haley, RE/MAX PREFERRED CHOICE","board":"REALTORS® Association of Edmonton","town_slug":"spruce-grove","hood_slug":"lakewood","area":""}